{"2429860":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"妹相随～黑白世界的缤纷冒险～","steam_appid":2429860,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[3062990,3155140],"detailed_description":"<h1>Steam Cards!<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/0c8e662162c730c6037afaa5a021a9ae.avif?t=1760542533\" width=620 height=76 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/fdcc069d1e219f78c04fbeefba0883e0.poster.avif?t=1760542533\" width=620 height=472 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/fdcc069d1e219f78c04fbeefba0883e0.webm?t=1760542533\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>有任何游戏问题——请联系官方客服，免费！！<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/1c773a786f0085578a0024226c9adc71.avif?t=1760542533\" width=600 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>关于游戏<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/4ac07d4bcc15fc9996fafa31d9843b0e.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=72 \/><\/span>生在奇幻世界的你，梦想着长大后像你的父亲一样，成为一名著名的冒险者。然而事实证明，故事只会故事——你大部分时间都在为小镇居民们打零工。你和身边的朋友们梦想着进军锦标赛八强，达成你们的终极目标——成为全国顶级公会。你的雄心壮志会实现吗？还是不可多得的机会注定从指间溜走，你的生活徒留单调乏味？<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/6d464c8ef5f7e53f2b4b08ee39347f2b.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=73 \/><\/span>作为所在城镇的冒险者公会成员，你的日常工作就是保护城镇中的居民——狩猎、捕杀危险的野兽，磨炼技艺，准备应对未来可能到来的任何挑战。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >除此以外，你还要悉心照料病重的妹妹。管理好家庭财务，维护你与妹妹的亲情……也许终有一日，你能够解开妹妹病重的谜团。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/57567ff55ec5a84b87f5822a9954b670.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=73 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/03ec63f52526d61270b7f10635bd0608.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=274 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/0aa3ffd1b9ef8c0f696a30d5e3cd36b3.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=274 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/c16afa15f63616f302856d30dbe53938.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=274 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/310a0ed3a67d5553e05fcfbdabf6e7b0.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=274 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/4ef491b47b1201591752a15b7090666d.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=274 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/93d5bf108fbca137eae01ef8119c0bdb.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=274 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/42300764e2f1e22481c7daeccd16aa6e.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=274 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/f637f88a10641c269759bf4edbc2c995.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=73 \/><\/span><strong>手绘黑白画风<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >虽然画面缺少色彩，但游戏中的世界绝对五彩缤纷！令人惊叹的黑白画面个性十足，一定会给你留下绝妙的回忆！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>独特战斗系统<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >数以万计的奇异怪物，加上几十个独特的可解锁技能，一定让你的冒险旅途挑战十足，兴奋到极致！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>可爱迷人的角色<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >维护你与妹妹、其他公会成员的关系，了解她们的喜好和特长，解锁每个角色特定的能力，一起向全国顶级公会之名冲锋吧！<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/4ac07d4bcc15fc9996fafa31d9843b0e.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=72 \/><\/span>生在奇幻世界的你，梦想着长大后像你的父亲一样，成为一名著名的冒险者。然而事实证明，故事只会故事——你大部分时间都在为小镇居民们打零工。你和身边的朋友们梦想着进军锦标赛八强，达成你们的终极目标——成为全国顶级公会。你的雄心壮志会实现吗？还是不可多得的机会注定从指间溜走，你的生活徒留单调乏味？<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2429860\/extras\/6d464c8ef5f7e53f2b4b08ee39347f2b.avif?t=1760542533\" width=616 height=73 \/><\/span>作为所在城镇的冒险者公会成员，你的日常工作就是保护城镇中的居民——狩猎、捕杀危险的野兽，磨炼技艺，准备应对未来可能到来的任何挑战。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >除此以外，你还要悉心照料病重的妹妹。管理好家庭财务，维护你与妹妹的亲情……也许终有一日，你能够解开妹妹病重的谜团。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps